<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts four hotel cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts four hotel cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber started coverage of four hotel companies, all with attractive ratings, a source at PaineWebber said.</p>
<p>-- Rated companies include Doubletree Corp, Promus Hotel Corp, Studio Plus Hotels Inc and Wyndham Hotel Corp.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Doubletree shares fell 1/4 to 40-5/16, Promus shares were unchanged at 28-3/4, Studio Plus shares fell 3/8 to 16-1/2 and Wyndham shares were unchanged at 21-1/2, all in early trading.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
